  "bodyHash": "DM8ntG4GKDs=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle</a>&nbsp;（或無Mantle版本使用的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Health Overlay</a>）為可選但建議安裝</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">CURIOS</a><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">（1.16+）</span> 或 </span><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">BAUBLES</a><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:12px\">（1.12）&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#000\"><strong>為 </strong></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>必要！</strong></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/645/754/bhc-wordmark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"497\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組以全新方式回歸舊版Tinkers' Construct的愛心罐，使其成為Baubles/Curios飾品！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">❤️</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">紅色愛心&nbsp;</span>-<span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 由敵對生物掉落</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">💛黃色愛心 - 由Boss生物（如凋靈）掉落</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">💚綠色愛心 - 由終界龍掉落</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\">💙藍色愛心 -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由獄卒獸（1.19+）或喚魔者（1.18-）掉落</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（所有掉落物均可透過設定檔調整）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每階層的愛心罐也可透過合成配方，利用前一階層的愛心罐製作。建議查看JEI等模組以了解各階層的合成方式。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💜靈魂愛心罐&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">僅</span>可用於靈魂護身符。作用類似不死圖騰，能將生命值回復至上限，消耗後會變回藍色愛心罐。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>愛心護身符 -</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一個欄位即可容納所有愛心罐</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（飾品類型可透過遊戲內或設定檔調整）</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/F2cKMdr.gif\" width=\"661\" height=\"496\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>靈魂愛心水晶：</strong>用於製作靈魂護身符和活力劍的合成材料。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>靈魂愛心護身符 -</strong>&nbsp;功能與愛心護身符相同，但可額外容納靈魂愛心罐</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>活力劍</strong> - 一把極為強大的劍，可透過愛心罐增加攻擊傷害。每個愛心罐增加2點攻擊傷害。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>凋靈骨頭 -</strong>&nbsp;合成材料，由凋靈骷髏掉落</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遺物蘋果&nbsp;</strong>- 合成材料，可用兩個鑽石和兩個綠寶石合成，食用後可獲得一分鐘的挖掘加速II、力量II和抗性II</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">獄卒獸也被改為掉落迴聲碎片，使其可再生。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">初始生命值可透過設定檔調整（設為0或以下將重置為預設值）。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color:#00f;font-size:24px\">內容更新</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x_7XavQNH6Q\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"><span style=\"color:#0ff;font-size:24px\">模組介紹</span></span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4a_l3ohdauc\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"><br></span></strong></p>\n</div><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tG5JKcW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://di8m9w6rqrh5d.cloudfront.net/1zObrQ89Q4wHhgFCfYIUhMUvmNf4XjxO/preview_d6fabf40-52a0-4b4c-ad08-cdbd7497dd4f.svg\" width=\"030\" height=\"30\"></em></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/traverse_joe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/08/10/magazine/10wmt/10wmt-articleLarge-v4.jpg?quality=75&amp;auto=webp&amp;disable=upscale\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></em></a><a href=\"https://twitch.tv/traverse_joe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://pngimg.com/uploads/twitch/twitch_PNG51.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></em></a></p>",
